SN MegaMore v1.0

This tiny utility adds a few movement sequences to your More? prompt.
This version includes five different sequences...

Quick & Easy Installation:

 1  Place it somewhere.  (PFiles: would be good.)

 2  Load up your bbstext(s) and go to line #1061 and #1064.  If you're
    using the default bbstext or haven't modified the lines, they should
    look like this:

    1061:  \q2\q1More[Y,c]\q3
    1064:  \q2\q1More[Y,n,c]\q3

    Change it to look like this:

    1061:  \q2\q1More[Y,c]\q3{#0SN:SN_MegaMore}\q3
    1064:  \q2\q1More[Y,n,c]\q3{#0SN:SN_MegaMore}\q3

    Modify the path to suit and remember, \ = CTRL-Y and { = CTRL-Q.

 3  Reload your bbstext/bbsmenu via CNet's Control Panel menu (option
    #3, "Text/menu reload  RAmiga-T" and you're all set!

(This sucker wasn't big enough to deserve it's own .guide, installer, icons,
help file, blah blah blah plus tax...)

